*
!.gitignore

# The eight Northlight product-catalog photos. storage/app/public/ is
# gitignored by stock Laravel because it's meant for runtime uploads, not
# source-controlled assets — but these are static catalog images the app
# requires to render correctly, with no upload flow that would ever
# recreate them. Left ignored, they would be invisible to `git push` and
# to any git-based deploy, and every product listing would show a broken
# image on a fresh clone. Named individually rather than `!images/` so a
# real future user upload landing in this directory stays ignored.
!images/
!images/sunglasses1.jpg
!images/sunglasses2.jpg
!images/sunglasses3.jpg
!images/sunglasses4.jpg
!images/eyeglasses1.jpg
!images/eyeglasses3.jpg
!images/eyeglasses4.jpg
!images/eyeglasses5.jpg
